{"bangumi":{"date":"2002-10-04","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/11/bb/67734_7xoje.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/11/bb/67734_7xoje.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/11/bb/67734_7xoje.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/11/bb/67734_7xoje.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/11/bb/67734_7xoje.jpg"},"summary":"《帕拉图之链》(Platonic Chain) 本作把不久后未来的涩谷作为舞台，描绘了一个叫做“帕拉图之链”的神秘地方，以及被这个地方所吸引的少女们的故事。原作曾在日本著名游戏杂志《Fami 通》上连载，动画化之后，运用了时下最流行的“Motion Capture”技术拍摄而成。曾在世界CG动画展示盛会[SIGGRAPH2001]上放映，并在欧洲最大的数字电影展[IMAGINA2002]的竞赛单元里得到好评。由于运用了全3DCG来表现少女们的动作，千叶和野中两位声优有机会亲自体验motion capture技术参与拍摄。这部分的内容被做成一个[motion capture版]的经过浓缩的小故事，作为DVD的映像特典呈现给大家。","name":"プラトニックチェーン","name_cn":"柏拉图之链","tags":[{"name":"TV","count":57,"total_count":1396983},{"name":"泡面番","count":39,"total_count":153766},{"name":"2002","count":38,"total_count":16484},{"name":"科幻","count":32,"total_count":251492},{"name":"3D","count":23,"total_count":50940},{"name":"小说改","count":21,"total_count":157998},{"name":"原创","count":20,"total_count":617551},{"name":"2002年10月","count":12,"total_count":671},{"name":"OVA","count":12,"total_count":363841},{"name":"千葉紗子","count":10,"total_count":87},{"name":"野中藍","count":9,"total_count":383},{"name":"2002年","count":6,"total_count":1057},{"name":"日本","count":5,"total_count":293487},{"name":"2002年十月番","count":3,"total_count":10},{"name":"半年番","count":3,"total_count":4319},{"name":"2000s","count":2,"total_count":3082},{"name":"伊丹あき","count":2,"total_count":33},{"name":"日本动画","count":2,"total_count":34835},{"name":"泡面","count":1,"total_count":10496},{"name":"亚兰隅子","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"2000s~2009s","count":1,"total_count":142},{"name":"忘记讲啥了所以二周目","count":1,"total_count":56},{"name":"2003","count":1,"total_count":16754},{"name":"7(+2)","count":1,"total_count":314},{"name":"SF","count":1,"total_count":7156},{"name":"独立动画","count":1,"total_count":2468},{"name":"WEB","count":1,"total